g and delivery service; Play, an online content streaming service; fintech activities; and Farfetch, a luxury fashion marketplace. It also performs operations and support services in the United States, South Korea, Taiwan, Singapore, China, Japan, Europe, the United Kingdom, and India. Coupang, Inc. was incorporated in 2010 and is headquartered in Seattle, Washington.","ceo_bio":"Mr. Bom  Kim | Founder, CEO & Chairman | Age 46 | Compensation: $3.2M (FY2025)","culture_narrative":"Employs approximately 108K people. Revenue per employee of $320K ranks in the below the sector median among Consumer Cyclical peers, with revenue growing 17%/yr across its filed history. Each employee generates $5K of free cash flow annually. Stock-based compensation of $4K per employee reflects an ownership culture. CEO compensation is 10\u00d7 revenue per employee (reasonable relative to workforce productivity). Governance score flags elevated compensation governance risk (9/10).","financial_summary":["Coupang, Inc. is a large-cap consumer cyclical business with a $27.2B market cap on $34.5B of annual revenue.","The top line has compounded at +19% over the past three years, the kind of sustained demand persistence that marks a compounder. Operating margins are expanding by +2.4pp year-over-year, which is one of the strongest signals that the moat is deepening.","Gross margins of 29% are the starting point for assessing pricing power.","The business throws off $522M in free cash flow \u2014 roughly 2 cents on every revenue dollar, which is the owner-earnings figure that actually belongs to shareholders, and cash conversion sits at 8.52\u00d7 so those profits are backed by real cash.","On the balance sheet, the balance sheet carries net cash, which is the gold standard: the business never has to make desperate decisions in a bad year, and interest coverage runs at 5.5\u00d7.","Shareholder yield is only 0.9%, a thin return of capital, and insider ownership is negligible, so management has little personal stake in the long-term outcome, and profit capture is only 0.2\u00d7 the fair share, suggesting no structural edge inside its industry."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Fragmented industry with below-average profit capture \u2014 no moat to protect margins","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Priced near or above estimated fair value, so the margin of safety has been bid away","sev":"amber","cat":"valuation","magnitude":0.07418067625477376},{"text":"Altman Z in the grey zone \u2014 financial health warrants monitoring","sev":"amber","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Above-average short interest at 6.2% of float","sev":"amber","cat":"sentiment"},{"text":"Consumer demand is fundamentally cyclical \u2014 a recession compresses both unit volume and pricing power, and operating leverage cuts both ways.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"E-commerce margin compression and tariff exposure \u2014 digital competition erodes pricing power while trade policy reshuffles supply-chain cost structures overnight.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Brand relevance decay \u2014 shifting consumer preferences and social-media-driven trends can strand inventory and invalidate positioning faster than product cycles can adapt.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Trading near the bottom of its 52-week range \u2014 the market is offering a discount","Valued at a 742% discount to sector median EV/EBITDA","Founder-led \u2014 owner alignment that often matters more than any incentive plan","Large open-market insider purchases (net $133.3M) \u2014 management putting its own capital behind the business","Growing faster than most Consumer Cyclical peers \u2014 taking share inside the profit pool","Among the least levered in Consumer Cyclical \u2014 the fortress balance sheet in its peer set","Consumer Cyclical sector outperforming the broader market over the past quarter"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Coupang, Inc. $CPNG Stock Acquired by Machina Capita